      <description><![CDATA[<h2>What&#x27;s New in HoloDock 1.0.6</h2><ul><li>Live theme preview now shows <strong>your desktop wallpaper</strong> behind the glass so opacity changes are easy to judge</li><li>After Install &amp; Relaunch (or reopen after an update), HoloDock greets you with <strong>All Set! You have the latest version.</strong></li></ul>]]></description>
